  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  instructionText: {fileID: 1680824538}
  pages:
  - "Welcome to the Quiz Room!\r\n\r\nThis quiz will test your understanding of:\r\n\u2022
    Centralization\r\n\u2022 Decentralization\r\n\u2022 Peer-to-Peer networks\r\n\r\nRead
    carefully and take your time.\r"
  - "How to play the quiz:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Each question has four options\r\n\u2022
    Select only ONE correct answer\r\n\u2022 Once selected, you cannot change it\r"
  - "Scoring rules:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Each correct answer gives points\r\n\u2022 No negative
    marking\r\n\u2022 Your final score will be shown at the end\r"
  - 'You are now ready!



    When you feel confident,

    press START to begin
    the quiz.



    Good luck!

'
